=== base ===
# Research Collaboration Agreement

This Agreement is made between Arnmouth Biotech Ltd (the "Company") and Kelderby University (the "University").

## 3. Reports
3.1 The University shall deliver a progress report every six months.

## 11. Confidentiality
11.1 Each party shall keep the other party's Confidential Information secret for three years.
11.2 The University shall not publish results without the Company's approval.

## 12. Publicity
12.1 The Company shall not use the University's name in advertising.
=== amendment ===
# Amendment Agreement

This Amendment is made on 6 September 2027 between Arnmouth Biotech Ltd (the "Company") and Kelderby University (the "University").

1. The clause headed "Confidentiality" is deleted and replaced with: "11.1 Each party shall keep the other party's Confidential Information secret for five years."
2. The clause entitled "Publicity" is deleted.
